      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Imo, it should be limited to one account only. Not multiple. Many people will simply verify for other people. I rather have it 'safe' and less chance of running into someone who has been verified by a friend of theirs while not being above the age of 18, which we all know will definitely happen on quite a big scale if people can verify more than once. \n\nThe only solution I see for this which could be; Allow people to retract their verification status and then be able to put it on an other account.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
