      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Still hoping we can have a system where we can verify multiple accounts with the same hash, with the hard rule that any action taken against one account would be applied to any account with the same hash. Would literally solve the issue people have with potential for abuse.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
