      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{664e2f86068c989af06352e8|full_name} I am an alter within a plural system. My host's first account was verified using my state ID (not a driver's license/learners). I was *not* able to verify this account using my driver's license. It seems that these two are the same to Persona, likely because both are technically a form of State ID despite serving two purposes.\n\nI do not have a passport as I have not yet needed to travel abroad. This may change within the coming years, but hopefully I won't have to edit this reply to update it with the information of whether or not it worked... (To future readers: If no such edit exists, then I still couldn't try it)",
      "viewerReactions": null,
