      "restoredAt": null,
      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I also need this, but for more than just two accounts. For alters and other reasons. I want to just be free to make alternates and verify them and feel safe doing so without judgement. I don't even care if VRChat kept all my personal information and kept a close watch on my accounts if it meant I can have my peace of mind to move between parts of myself without judgement. This one verification for one account Facebook'ish lockdown model forces me to deal with a serious question of making private parts of my life public that I really shouldn't have to. Being locked to one account, even just two accounts if I verified with a passport also, removes a critical part of what I enjoyed about VRChat - being able to escape.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
