      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "VRChat is a second life, and if so, I believe it is natural and reasonable to allow a third life as well.\n\nI am not ignoring the problem of abuse through multiple accounts, but I think that should be addressed through separate measures.\n\nI have no hesitation about paying for an nth life.",
